    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flagdashers</strong>\u00a0is your new obsession\u2014a pulse-pounding multiplayer battle game where you'll leap, sprint, and snag the flag in exhilarating 1v1 or 3v3 showdowns. Pick your hero from Team Black or Team Gray, each bursting with cuteness and armed with unique powers like explosive arrows and playful tricks. Outwit your opponents and be the first team to win 3 out of 5 rounds for the glory. Created by a band of friends dedicated to leveling up multiplayer fun, Flagdashers promises high-energy gameplay with a delightful twist. Dive in and let the flag-dashing frenzy begin!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847600/extras/3729f4cf67cca1b788b9fc1f9b99c060.poster.avif?t=1750193907\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847600/extras/3729f4cf67cca1b788b9fc1f9b99c060.webm?t=1750193907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847600/extras/3729f4cf67cca1b788b9fc1f9b99c060.mp4?t=1750193907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is not pay-to-win</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The team is committed to not introducing abilities or cosmetics that can be unlocked with purchases and offer players an in-game advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Capture the Flag to win</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The flag sits perched on the top-middle platform, daring players to scale its heights and seize it using explosive or teleportation arrows. Grab the flag, and a countdown starts ticking. If the flag bearer is defeated or the timer expires, the flag returns to its starting spot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us on Discord: </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flagdashers</strong>\u00a0is your new obsession\u2014a pulse-pounding multiplayer battle game where you'll leap, sprint, and snag the flag in exhilarating 1v1 or 3v3 showdowns. Pick your hero from Team Black or Team Gray, each bursting with cuteness and armed with unique powers like explosive arrows and playful tricks. Outwit your opponents and be the first team to win 3 out of 5 rounds for the glory. Created by a band of friends dedicated to leveling up multiplayer fun, Flagdashers promises high-energy gameplay with a delightful twist. Dive in and let the flag-dashing frenzy begin!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847600/extras/3729f4cf67cca1b788b9fc1f9b99c060.poster.avif?t=1750193907\" width=620 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847600/extras/3729f4cf67cca1b788b9fc1f9b99c060.webm?t=1750193907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847600/extras/3729f4cf67cca1b788b9fc1f9b99c060.mp4?t=1750193907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is not pay-to-win</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The team is committed to not introducing abilities or cosmetics that can be unlocked with purchases and offer players an in-game advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Capture the Flag to win</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The flag sits perched on the top-middle platform, daring players to scale its heights and seize it using explosive or teleportation arrows. Grab the flag, and a countdown starts ticking. If the flag bearer is defeated or the timer expires, the flag returns to its starting spot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us on Discord: </p>",
